    "## Downloads + requirements\n\nClick the file name to download it. Put each file in the folder shown (inside `ComfyUI/models/`).\n\n| Folder | File (click = download) | Size |\n|---|---|---|\n| `diffusion_models/` | [mage_flow_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Mage-Flow/resolve/main/diffusion_models/mage_flow_int8_convrot.safetensors) | 4.16 GB |\n| `text_encoders/` | [qwen3vl_4b_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Mage-Flow/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_4b_bf16.safetensors) | 8.88 GB |\n| `vae/` | [mage_flow_vae_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Mage-Flow/resolve/main/vae/mage_flow_vae_bf16.safetensors) | 0.35 GB |\n\n**VRAM:** on a 24 GB card ComfyUI held 12.4 GiB. Capped to a 10 GiB budget (`--reserve-vram`) the whole-GPU peak was 10.9 GiB, the runs took 9 to 11 s and the pictures were pixel-identical. **Not verified on a 12 GB card.**\n\n**Run on ComfyUI 0.45.3** (Mage-Flow support arrived in ComfyUI PR #15026; older versions were not tested). **No custom nodes.**\n\nLicence: MIT (Microsoft Mage-Flow, github.com/microsoft/Mage).\n"
   ]
  }
